# NOTICE

Third-party CAD models keep their original ownership and terms. Downloaded models are unmodified except for filenames.

## Raspberry Pi models

- `RaspberryPi_CM5.step`: Raspberry Pi Compute Module 5 (CM5R5), Raspberry Pi Product Information Portal document RP-007222-DD-2.
- `Amphenol_10164227-1001A1RLF.step`: Amphenol 10164227-1001A1RLF, from Raspberry Pi's CM5 IO board KiCad design files (`cm5io-KiCAD.zip`).

## Manufacturer models

- `TE_1-2199230-4.step`: TE Connectivity customer view model CVM_1-2199230-4. The 1-2199230-5 fitted here differs only in gold thickness.

